  "body": "## Release Notes\n\n* `cargo vet check --frozen` (a disabled network) will infer the existence of crates using versions\n  in audits when checking audit-as-crates-io policies (#661)\n* The `--mode` argument to `cargo vet diff` and `cargo vet inspect` has changed in the following\n  ways (#701):\n  - `sourcegraph` is no longer supported\n  - A `custom_url` option has been added, which allows providing a url template.\n  - The previous mode is independently cached for the two commands (previously, they shared a single\n    cached value).\n  - `crates.io` is now supported (only for `inspect`).\n* Authorization can now be done via git-credential helpers (#640).\n* reqwest and other dependencies have been updated and audited to eliminate RUSTSEC vulnerabilities\n  (#700, #704).\n* MSRV has been updated to 1.85.\n\n## Download cargo-vet 0.10.3\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [cargo-vet-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/mozilla/cargo-vet/releases/download/v0.10.3/cargo-vet-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/mozilla/cargo-vet/releases/download/v0.10.3/cargo-vet-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [cargo-vet-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/mozilla/cargo-vet/releases/download/v0.10.3/cargo-vet-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/mozilla/cargo-vet/releases/download/v0.10.3/cargo-vet-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [cargo-vet-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/mozilla/cargo-vet/releases/download/v0.10.3/cargo-vet-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/mozilla/cargo-vet/releases/download/v0.10.3/cargo-vet-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [cargo-vet-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/mozilla/cargo-vet/releases/download/v0.10.3/cargo-vet-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/mozilla/cargo-vet/releases/download/v0.10.3/cargo-vet-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n\n",
